<title>USA: MBIA has capacity for Ga. Muni Electric Authority.</title>
<headline>MBIA has capacity for Ga. Muni Electric Authority.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>MBIA Insurance Corp said it has limited secondary market insurance capacity for Georgia Municipal Electric Authority power revenue bonds.</p>
<p>Capacity, initially limited to $25 million per firm, will be available on a first-come, first-served basis. For more information, call 800-624-2669.</p>
<p>--U.S. Municipal Desk, 212-859-1650</p>
</text>
